  "bodyHash": "7accc87898913ac5",
  "content": "\n\n<p>此模組提供與 Macaw 的橋樑、柵欄、屋頂、家具與階梯，以及 Modding Legacy 所開發模組的多重相容性。</p>\n<p>無論是 Blue Skies 還是 Premium Wood。</p>\n<p>此模組會自動使用其他模組的材料來新增橋樑、屋頂或柵欄。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>我已安裝了 Macaw's Bridges - Modding Legacy，我擔心安裝此模組會刪除所有已放置的橋樑。</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>請放心，此模組會將舊版相容性中的所有舊方塊與物品進行轉換。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模組為 Macaw 系列模組的非官方附加模組。若模組發生當機或錯誤，請於此<a href=\"https://github.com/Samlegamer/Macaw-s-Addons/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題頁面</a>回報。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>本模組支援：&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- Macaw's Bridges</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1089/687/2025-02-05_22.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- Macaw's Roofs</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1089/694/2025-02-05_22.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- Macaw's Fences</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1089/688/2025-02-05_22.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- Macaw's Furnitures</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1089/695/2025-02-05_22.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- Macaw's Stairs</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1089/690/2025-02-05_22.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>1.1 更新（活板門／門／小徑／窗戶）<br></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1105/208/2025-02-22_21-12-31-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>必要依賴：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AddonsLib</strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>選用依賴：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Mods</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blue Skies</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/premium-wood\" rel=\"nofollow\">Premium Wood</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structure-gel-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Structure Gel API</a></p>",
